sequenceDiagram
participant Job as "allocationJob: Control"
participant Service as "allocationRunService: Service"
participant API as "mainController: Controller"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
participant Notify as "notificationService: Service"
Job->>Service: closeRunAndPublishResults(businessDate)
Service->>+DB: Read approved plan outcomes and short reasons
DB-->>-Service: Complete/short orders and trace
Service->>DB: Mark run closed and persist outcome history
Service->>Notify: notifySalesAndReviewers(outcomes)
Notify->>DB: Create scoped notifications
Service-->>API: Run result when queried
API-->>Notify: GET /api/v1/allocation-runs/by-date/{businessDate}
Note over Service,DB: Short orders have no reservation and are not automatically carried to a later run.

